%I A401094 #11 Oct 16 2026 19:02:58
%S A401094 1,2,4,11,28,80,228,687,2099,6639,21343,70197,234581,797050,2745301,
%T A401094 9579107,33802325,120519910,433676469,1573622683,5753045820,
%U A401094 21176492893,78431373122,292121552269,1093600980921,4113255339230,15537277658656,58921958732957
%N A401094 Number of bicolored trees on n unlabeled vertices in which the black vertices form a nonempty connected subset.
%C A401094 The black nodes form a connected induced subgraph. a(n) is then the total number of inequivalent connected induced subgraphs summed over unlabeled trees with n nodes, where equivalence means under all isomorphisms of the tree.
%H A401094 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A401094/b401094.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..500</a>
%H A401094 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Vertex-InducedSubgraph.html">Vertex-Induced Subgraph</a>.
%e A401094 The a(3) = 4 trees are: (black nodes are x and white nodes are o).
%e A401094     x---o---o   o---x---o  x---x---o  x---x---x
%e A401094 The a(4) = 11 trees are:
%e A401094     x   o  o   o  x   o  x   x  x   x   x---o---o---o   o---x---o---o
%e A401094      \ /    \ /    \ /    \ /    \ /
%e A401094       o      x      x      x      x     x---x---o---o   o---x---x---o
%e A401094       |      |      |      |      |
%e A401094       o      o      o      o      x     x---x---x---o   x---x---x---x
%o A401094 (PARI)
%o A401094 EulerTS(p)={my(n=serprec(p,x)-1); exp(x*Ser(dirmul(Vec(serchop(p,1),-n), vector(n,k,1/k)))) }
%o A401094 seq(n)={my(u=v=w=O(x)); for(n=1, n, u=x*EulerTS(u); v=x*EulerTS(v+u); w=(w + v)*u); Vec(v+w + (subst(v,x,x^2) - (u+v)^2 + u^2)/2 - u*w) }
%Y A401094 Cf. A038056, A401091 (labeled version), A401093 (rooted), A401096.
%K A401094 nonn,new
%O A401094 1,2
%A A401094 _Andrew Howroyd_, Oct 16 2026
